---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Home">
  <img
    src="/morgan-nu-portrait-hq.jpg"
    alt="Portrait of Morgan Pfaff outdoors on Northeastern's campus"
    class="card-img"
  />
  <p class="photo-credit">Photo by Matthew Modoono/Northeastern University</p>
  <p class="pill">PhD Candidate · UC Berkeley/UCSF Bioengineering</p>
  <h1>Morgan Pfaff</h1>
  <p class="tagline">Bioengineer</p>
  <p>
    Hi, I'm Morgan! I'm a PhD candidate in the joint UC Berkeley/UCSF
    Bioengineering program, engineering hyaluronic acid hydrogels in Dr.
    Kevin Healy's lab to help the body regenerate tissue after complex
    soft tissue injuries. When I'm not in the lab, I'm volunteering with
    Food Not Bombs East Bay or talking with anyone who wants to chase
    their own passion in STEM.
  </p>
  <div class="home-cta">
    <a class="btn" href="/about/">More about me</a>
    <a class="btn secondary" href="/projects/">See my work</a>
  </div>
</Layout>
